  "text": " Milo and the Red Balls. A story to read together. Open your book to page 3. Listen and look at the pictures. Page 3. A sunny day. Milo has a Red Ball. Hello Pip. Let's play. Turn the page. Page 4. Oh no. Milo kicks the ball. The ball rolls away. Oh no, where's my ball? Turn the page. Page 5 under the tree. Milo and Pip look. Is it under the tree? Pip finds a red leaf. No, it is a leaf. Turn the page. Page 6 in the box. Next they see a box. Is it in the box? Pip looks in the box. No, it is a hat. Turn the page. Page 7 behind the bench. Pip sees something red. Look behind the bench. Milo looks behind the bench. My Red Ball. Turn the page. Page 8, friends help friends. Milo smiles. Thank you Pip. You're welcome. Milo and Pip play together. Let's play. At the end.",
